Subject: [PATCH 78/78] =?UTF-8?q?Nova:=20Ko'rgazma=20=E2=80=94=20Instagram?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20post/reel=20ilova=20ichida,=20rasmiy=20embed?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Egasi tasdiqlagan: `instagram.com/(reel|reels|p|tv)/<kod>` havolali
ko'rgazmada "Instagram'da ko'rish" (ru "Смотреть в Instagram", en
"View on Instagram") — pastdan varaq, ichida Instagram'ning RASMIY
ommaviy embed sahifasi `https://www.instagram.com/<p|reel>/<kod>/embed/`
(token kerak emas). Lenta kartasidagi ko'rgazma ma'lumotida ham.

- avtomatik ijro yo'q (WebView media uchun bosishni talab qiladi);
- embed ustida hech narsa yo'q: yopish tepada, "Instagram'da ochish"
  pastda;
- embed sahifasidan boshqa har qanday asosiy o'tish ("View on
  Instagram", profil...) WebView ichida ochilmaydi — tashqarida;
- yuklanmasa (tarmoq/HTTP xato, 20 s javobsizlik) — embed o'rnida
  "Instagram'da ochish"; fonga o'tilsa sahifa bo'shatiladi;
- varaq ochiq turganda ko'rgazma musiqasi pauzada, yopilgach davom
  etadi (🔇 bo'lmasa).

Profil havolasi (`instagram.com/<username>`) — avvalgidek tashqi tugma.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
